### ============================================
### TRAINING RECOMMENDATION ENDPOINTS
### ============================================

### Create Training Recommendation (HR/Admin only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/training-recommendation/create
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "competencyId": "{{competencyId}}",
    "title": "JavaScript Advanced Course",
    "description": "Comprehensive course covering advanced JavaScript concepts",
    "link": "https://example.com/course/javascript-advanced",
    "difficultyLevel": 3,
    "courseId": null
}

### Get All Recommendations
GET {{baseUrl}}/training-recommendation/list
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Recommendation by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/training-recommendation/{{recommendationId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Recommendations by Competency
GET {{baseUrl}}/training-recommendation/competency/{{competencyId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Recommendations by Difficulty Level
GET {{baseUrl}}/training-recommendation/difficulty/3
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update Recommendation (HR/Admin only)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/training-recommendation/update/{{recommendationId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "title": "JavaScript Advanced Course - Updated",
    "description": "Updated course description",
    "difficultyLevel": 4,
    "link": "https://example.com/course/javascript-advanced-v2"
}

### Delete Recommendation (HR/Admin only)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/training-recommendation/delete/{{recommendationId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

